'''Mini-Saurus''' (ミニザウルス, ''Minizaurusu'', '''Minisaurus''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 10.7 Update|Version 10.7]].

==Effect==
Research Power UP (Sm): All Cats' recharge times are reduced by 26 frames (0.87 sec).

